#: ../../../source/user_guide/installation/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"PyBaMM is available on GNU/Linux, MacOS and Windows. It can be installed "
"using ``uv``, ``pip``, or ``conda``, or from source."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/installation/index.rst:10
msgid ""
"PyBaMM can be installed via `uv <https://docs.astral.sh/uv/>`__ from `PyPI "
"<https://pypi.org/project/pybamm>`__."
msgstr ""

