msgid "conda install -c conda-forge pybamm-base"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/user_guide/installation/index.rst:42
msgid ""
"The PyBaMM Conda recipe is not currently maintained and lags several "
"releases behind. As a result, installations via Conda will provide an "
"outdated version. To access the latest version, consider installing PyBaMM "
"using pip."
